[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="InventoryItemDefinition" format=3 uid="uid://baopg28dt8iet"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/data/inventory_item_definition.gd" id="1_definition"]
[ext_resource type="Script" uid="uid://dy1gfjjj466vx" path="res://scripts/data/gate_condition.gd" id="2_condition"]
[ext_resource type="Script" uid="uid://bj1sj4y8aeenm" path="res://scripts/data/inventory_item_state.gd" id="3_state"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="GateCondition_has_field_book"]
script = ExtResource("2_condition")
all_of = Array[StringName]([&"has_field_book"])

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="InventoryItemState_field_book"]
script = ExtResource("3_state")
condition = SubResource("GateCondition_has_field_book")
label = "Manual"
description = "Theo's Ghostbusters field manual and gear log."
action_input = &"open_field_book"
action_key_hint = "Q"
action_kind = &"book"
book_title = "Theo's Field Manual"
book_pages = Array[String](["[b]Ghostbusters SOP & Equipment Safety Guide[/b]

Property of Theo Griggs. If found, please return to the tech cart.

This field copy combines the safety manual with Theo's working gear log for tonight's containment watch.", "[b]Section 4.2 - Siren-Class Containment Cells[/b]

Charged cells contain pressurized Violet-Grade ionized sludge. Standard discharge is at range, against a manifested entity.

A Manual Purge is an emergency override for point-blank discharge. A charged cell weighs about 15 lbs.", "[b]Sections 5.3, 5.4, 7.2[/b]

Purge Pigment can be driven through standard gloves during a point-blank Manual Purge, staining palms and cuticles for 48-72 hours.

The back-pressure valve only pops when the nozzle is obstructed by a solid object during discharge.

The Manual Override lever requires a deliberate two-stage pinch-and-twist. It should not flip from impact, vibration, or spectral interference.", "[b]Sections 8.1, 8.2[/b]

Class-5 ghost-touch leaves jagged, branching frost patterns. A precise circular wound is not a documented ghost-touch pattern.

A manifested Class-5 radiates ectoplasm in a roughly 360 degree spread. A directional fan on one wall indicates a focused channel, not a normal manifestation.", "[b]Theo's Gear Log - 12th Floor Watch[/b]

8:42 PM - Cart loaded for 1221 containment watch.
8:55 PM - Siren Cell A checked: charged, sealed, valve intact.
9:00 PM - Watch begins. I am in 1218 tech-prep.
9:05 PM - Pipe joint burst near 1218. Gear got soaked. Mara came to help.
9:06 PM - Siren Cell A missing from cart. I thought I miscounted. I did not report it.

Note to self: Dr. Pemberton was around the cart during prep, 'helping' with capture-tool maintenance."])

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_definition")
item_id = &"theo_field_book"
states = [SubResource("InventoryItemState_field_book")]
